{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini PacRunner is a very fun and classic game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode: There are over 100 levels, and players need to control their game characters to finish all the beans in each level to clear;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive mode: You can compete with your friends on the same stage here to see who can earn points before their lives are exhausted. Each player starts with 4 lives and can earn points by defeating monsters and eating beans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 different roles, 7 different maps, and 10+different skill options available</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928840?t=1759664668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928840/24d282b1fff82f414ad54ba575063dd666f494e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759664668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928840/b48f3c22b64bbfabe3c9ce6da00083240d1bf588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759664668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928840/b48f3c22b64bbfabe3c9ce6da00083240d1bf588/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759664668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini PacRunner is a very fun and classic game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode: There are over 100 levels, and players need to control their game characters to finish all the beans in each level to clear;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive mode: You can compete with your friends on the same stage here to see who can earn points before their lives are exhausted. Each player starts with 4 lives and can earn points b